      ],
      "title": "Don't overwrite error message from dumpcap",
      "message": "Don't overwrite error message from dumpcap\n\nPreviously, the errno message obtained from dumpcap would be overwritten\nby the call to sync_pipe_close_command, so no information about the\nfailure would be passed on. This is fixed by ignoring the message from\nsync_pipe_close_command, as it is probably less useful than the message\nwe already have.\n",
      "author_name": "James Ring",
      "author_email": "sjr@jdns.org",
      "authored_date": "2024-01-10T07:27:37.000-08:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
